  "note_on_77_and_82": "77-O16CBA and 82-O16CBA share the molecular formula C53H84N2O14 and the same calculated and observed m/z (973.60 / 973.73) in Figure 2F. They are constitutional isomers and their SMILES differ. An internal consistency win for the table, and a reminder that mass cannot see connectivity."
